msgid "Kernel module is loaded"
msgstr "核心模組已載入"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:238
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:293
msgid "If you've just installed, it is recommended to restart the computer."
msgstr "如果剛完成安裝，建議重新啟動電腦。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:246
msgid ""
"Secure Boot prevents the driver from loading, as OpenRazer's kernel modules "
"built by DKMS are usually unsigned."
msgstr ""
"Secure Boot 會阻止驅動程式載入，因為 DKMS 建置的 OpenRazer 核心模組通常未經簽署。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:268
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:278
msgid "Check Secure Boot (EFI) status"
msgstr "檢查 Secure Boot (EFI) 狀態"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:270
msgid ""
"Secure boot is enabled. Turn it off in the system's EFI settings or sign the "
"modules yourself."
msgstr ""
"Secure Boot 已啟用。請在系統的 EFI 設定中將其關閉，或自行簽署模組。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:280
msgid ""
"Unable to automatically check. If it's enabled, turn it off in the system's "
"EFI settings or sign the modules yourself."
msgstr ""
"無法自動檢查。如果已啟用，請在系統的 EFI 設定中將其關閉，或自行簽署模組。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:289
msgid "User account has been added to the 'plugdev' group"
msgstr "使用者帳號已加入「plugdev」群組"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:291
msgid "Run this command, log out, then log back in to the computer:"
msgstr "請執行此命令，登出後再重新登入電腦："

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:294
msgid ""
"This is required so that your user account (and daemon) has permission to "
"access the driver files in /sys/bus/hid/drivers"
msgstr ""
"這是必要步驟，使用者帳號 (及常駐程式) 才有權限存取 /sys/bus/hid/drivers 下的驅動程式檔案"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:303
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:313
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:334
msgid "Device can be accessed using plugdev permissions"
msgstr "可使用 plugdev 權限存取裝置"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:305
msgid ""
"Unable to check as the drivers sysfs path for this Linux kernel is non-"
"standard."
msgstr ""
"此 Linux 核心的驅動程式 sysfs 路徑非標準，無法檢查。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:315
msgid "Unable to check because OpenRazer's modules are not loaded."
msgstr "因 OpenRazer 的模組未載入，無法檢查。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:336
msgid ""
"Permissions for OpenRazer's device files (/sys/bus/hid/drivers) are not set "
"correctly. They should be owned as root:plugdev (owner/group)"
msgstr ""
"OpenRazer 裝置檔案 (/sys/bus/hid/drivers) 的權限設定不正確，應由 root:plugdev (擁有者/群組) 擁有"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:337
msgid ""
"Replugging the hardware and then restarting the daemon usually fixes the "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"重新插拔硬體並重新啟動常駐程式通常可解決此問題。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:338
msgid ""
"Alternately, improperly configured udev rules (such as a missing PID) may "
"cause this to happen."
msgstr ""
"此外，設定不當的 udev 規則 (例如缺少 PID) 也可能導致此問題。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:348
msgid "Razer hardware is present for kernel"
msgstr "核心可偵測到 Razer 硬體"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:350
msgid "The Linux kernel does not see hardware with a VID of 1532."
msgstr "Linux 核心偵測不到 VID 為 1532 的硬體。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:351
msgid "Check the device and USB port is working. Try a different port."
msgstr "請檢查裝置與 USB 連接埠是否正常運作，或嘗試其他連接埠。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:371
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:402
msgid "Check device compatibility"
msgstr "檢查裝置相容性"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:373
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:456
msgid "Unable to retrieve this data from OpenRazer's website."
msgstr "無法從 OpenRazer 網站取得此資料。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:374
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:457
msgid ""
"Check the OpenRazer website to confirm your device is listed as supported."
msgstr ""
"請前往 OpenRazer 網站，確認裝置是否列於支援清單中。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:375
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:458
msgid ""
"If you're checking OpenRazer's GitHub repository, check the 'stable' branch."
msgstr ""
"如果要檢視 OpenRazer 的 GitHub 儲存庫，請切換至「stable」分支。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:404
msgid ""
"The following PIDs are not supported in the latest stable release of "
"OpenRazer:"
msgstr ""
"OpenRazer 最新穩定版本不支援下列 PID："

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:406
msgid ""
"Check OpenRazer's issues and pull requests to see the status for your "
"device. Create an issue if necessary."
msgstr ""
"請檢視 OpenRazer 的 issues 與 pull requests，了解裝置的狀態；如有需要，請建立新 issue。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:443
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:454
#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:464
msgid "OpenRazer is the latest version"
msgstr "OpenRazer 為最新版本"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:445
msgid "There is a new version of OpenRazer available."
msgstr "OpenRazer 有新版本可用。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:446
msgid ""
"New versions add support for more devices and address device-specific issues."
msgstr ""
"新版本會新增更多裝置支援，並修正特定裝置的問題。"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:447
msgid "Your version: 0.0.0"
msgstr "目前版本：0.0.0"

#: polychromatic/troubleshoot/openrazer.py:448
msgid "Latest version: 0.0.0"
msgstr "最新版本：0.0.0"

